[2.958471, "o", "Stado — policy-controlled queue and compute control plane.\r\n\r\nUsage: stado [COMMAND]\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  capabilities          List Stado capability families, variants, providers and active selections\r\n  overview              One operator snapshot: jobs, active workers, quota, budgets, burn and credits\r\n  blast-radius          Inventory a dependency's live resources, auth, consumers, storage, and DR coverage\r\n  resources             Inventory, plan, execute, verify, and restore resource operations\r\n  optimize              Inspect and control autonomous placement and resource reconciliation\r\n  billing               Inspect or refresh cross-cloud costs, grants, burn, and credit balances\r\n  azure                 Authenticate an Azure operator and repair the Stado RBAC contract\r\n  cloudflare            Configure Cloudflare Tunnel ingress and DNS through Stado-held credentials\r\n  mail                  Search and deterministically analyze Gmail messages without modifying them\r\n  disk-cleanup          Run registry-aut"]
[2.958496, "o", "horized cleanup for this local target\r\n  install-disk-cleanup  Install the registry-controlled cleanup watch on this Mac\r\n  machine               Stable JSON machine interface\r\n  submit                Submit a job (or batch) to the queue\r\n  status                Show job status\r\n  results               Download job results\r\n  cancel                Cancel a queued or running job\r\n  job                   Rerun or watch one job\r\n  agent                 Run local GPU agent. Polls queue, respects Vast.ai renters\r\n  coordinator           Run the provider-neutral scheduling tick locally\r\n  dashboard             Run the Stado API listener for the wisent-compute queue\r\n  quota                 GPU quota inspection and increase requests across WC_PROVIDERS\r\n  profiles              List available submit profiles, or show one profile's JSON\r\n  config                Inspect or change stado configuration: show | validate | init | set\r\n  artifact              Publish and consume immutable, versioned artifacts\r\n  release     "]
[2.958505, "o", "          Build once, sign, promote, roll out, and roll back product releases\r\n"]
[2.958511, "o", "  schedule              Manage recurring (cron) jobs — submit a command on a cron schedule\r\n  cost                  Per-job and per-batch cost reporting from observed wall-times\r\n  registry              Manage the canonical compute-target registry in configured Stado storage\r\n  builds                Manage native build recipes: poll a repo, build on new commits\r\n"]
[2.958516, "o", "  fleet                 Add machines to the fleet, group them, hold their SSH keys, and diagnose the workers: enroll, join/approve, key, doctor\r\n  identity              Which host holds which identity, and whether that is still true\r\n  host                  Manage operating-system resources on registry hosts\r\n  bootstrap             Provision wisent-compute services persistently across reboots\r\n  vast                  Vast.ai marketplace host-listing (rent our idle GPU)\r\n"]
